# 🌿 **Healthmate – Your Personalized Wellness Guide**

> 🧠 **AI-powered nutrition assistant** that detects nutrient deficiencies and recommends the right foods—so you can stay healthy, energized, and in control.

![Python](https://img.shields.io/badge/Python-3.8+-blue?logo=python)
![Flask](https://img.shields.io/badge/Flask-Backend-lightgrey?logo=flask)
![Machine Learning](https://img.shields.io/badge/ML-SVM%20%7C%20XGBoost-green)
![License](https://img.shields.io/badge/License-MIT-yellow)

## ✨ **Key Features**

* 🔍 **Smart Deficiency Detection** – SVM model predicts if a nutrient deficiency exists.
* 🏷 **Precise Classification** – XGBoost identifies the *type* of deficiency (Vitamin D, Iron, Calcium, etc.).
* 🥗 **Personalized Food Suggestions** – Curated meal ideas that match your dietary preferences (vegetarian, vegan, gluten-free).
* ⚡ **Instant Results** – Clean, responsive web interface built with HTML, CSS, and JavaScript.
* 🔒 **Privacy First** – Processes user input in real time; no personal data is stored.

## 🛠 **Tech Stack**

| Layer        | Tools & Libraries                                  |
| ------------ | -------------------------------------------------- |
| **Backend**  | Python 3, Flask, Scikit-learn, XGBoost, TensorFlow |
| **Frontend** | HTML, CSS, JavaScript                              |
| **Data**     | Pandas, NumPy, curated Kaggle nutritional dataset  |
| **Deploy**   | Heroku / AWS / Render *(optional)*                 |

## 🚀 **Quick Start**

```bash
# 1️⃣ Clone the repository
git clone <repo-url>
cd healthmate

# 2️⃣ Create & activate a virtual environment
python3 -m venv venv
source venv/bin/activate   # Windows: venv\Scripts\activate

# 3️⃣ Install dependencies
pip install -r requirements.txt

# 4️⃣ Run the app
flask run
```

➡️ Open your browser: **[http://127.0.0.1:5000](http://127.0.0.1:5000)**

## 🧭 **How to Use**

1. 📝 **Sign up** and fill out the lifestyle & diet questionnaire.
2. 🤖 **Get Results** – Real-time prediction of nutrient deficiencies.
3. 🥑 **Follow Recommendations** – Receive a custom food list and downloadable PDF report.

## 📂 **Project Structure**

```
healthmate/
├─ app.py            # Flask backend
├─ models/           # Trained ML models (SVM, XGBoost)
├─ templates/        # HTML pages
├─ static/           # CSS / JS / images
├─ data/             # Nutritional datasets
└─ requirements.txt
```

